{
  "title": "Windows Print Spooler Service Suspicious File Creation",
  "description": "The query digs in Windows print spooler drivers folder for any file creations. This behavior is used from PoC Exploit of CVE-2021-34527, CVE-2021-1675 or CVE-2022-21999.\n",
  "query": "'Log Source' = 'SOC Windows Sysmon Logs' and (Action = 'FileCreated') and ('Process Name' like '*.dll') and ('Target Filename' like 'C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\SYSTEM32\\\\\\\\SPOOL\\\\\\\\drivers\\\\\\\\x64\\\\\\\\\\\\3\\\\\\\\*' or 'Target Filename' like 'C:\\\\\\\\WINDOWS\\\\\\\\SYSTEM32\\\\\\\\SPOOL\\\\\\\\drivers\\\\\\\\x64\\\\\\\\\\\\4\\\\\\\\*')",
  "level": "medium",
